      "statement": "The @callidescope/configuration package reads callidescope.config.ts for workspace and project configuration, resolves defaults, handles flag precedence (flags may only override declared values), and enforces two per-project gated limits: maximumDepth (default 6) and maximumBreadth (no default).",
