      "statement": "The @callidescope/output package renders findings into markdown (tree view with anchors), mermaid (flowchart diagrams), and JSON formats; OutputMarkdownService splices blocks between anchors with byte-for-byte staleness checking; ProjectReportsService finds owned findings and unread projects.",
