      "id": "claim_8029ea1f57904a80a98003156e076d2e",
      "statement": "Callidescope's entry point rules are additive: declared addresses, framework decorators (13 defaults), exported functions from barrel files, lifecycle methods, bootstrap functions, and orphan promotion (callables with no callers). Orphan promotion is a safety net against missing rules silently removing subtrees.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://projects/ic-suite/callidescope/callidescope-configuration/README.md#L66-L92",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:54ea6dd47927a01343646730cafbfe85af49a460a32ded15d5044180058bae38:"
