        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4e722cddf22842858d57322406548637",
      "statement": "Exclusions filter collection, not discovery: excluded files remain in the TypeScript program (compiled and type-checked) but their callables are never collected; a call into an excluded file becomes an unresolved call, making depth a floor rather than a measurement.",
